# This frontend is plain static HTML/CSS/JS with no build step (no Vite,
# CRA, or other bundler), so Vercel project env vars are NOT injected into
# the page at build time - there's nothing for VITE_*/REACT_APP_* style
# variables to do here.
#
# The one thing that would normally be an env var - the backend API's base
# URL - is instead a plain constant in frontend/js/config.js. After
# deploying the backend to Vercel, update that one line to your backend
# project's URL, e.g.:
#
#   https://portfolio-api.vercel.app
#
# This file exists only to document that, and is not read by anything.